<!-- Do (design-smithy §1, §2, §4.4): transitions only. Every form of Smithy posts to -/do/<name> with the session token, which
    the framework checks before a transition runs; each transition calls the one operation of its name through the facade
    (Smithy/SmithyForms.js run, which has each form's fields) and answers 303: to the page of what was made or changed, or
    back to the form's returnTo, a path under this mount, with the refusal's text. Nothing here is kept by a cache. -->
